WEBVTT

00:10:28.076 --> 00:10:33.116
I would like to ask you
to do one of these things,

00:10:33.156 --> 00:10:37.156
to make one of these choices
that we can make every day.

00:10:37.196 --> 00:10:40.276
I'd like you to make
that choice right now.

00:10:40.316 --> 00:10:42.316
Here’s my challenge to you:

00:10:43.796 --> 00:10:46.436
think about someone you miss,

00:10:46.476 --> 00:10:48.596
that you just haven't seen in a while

00:10:48.636 --> 00:10:50.396
or you haven't had contact with,

00:10:50.436 --> 00:10:52.476
and you'd like to make contact.

00:10:52.836 --> 00:10:55.396
You don't even have to have
a particular reason.

00:10:56.076 --> 00:11:02.356
Now I want you to take out your phone
or whatever device you use, right now,